 "spec": "HALDEN PARCEL CO.: DOMESTIC TARIFF (edition 9)\n\nAll prices are in cents. Apply the sections in order.\n\n\u00a71 Prohibited items. Lithium batteries, aerosols and perishable goods are not accepted for carriage.\n\n\u00a72 Weight. All weights are rounded UP to the next whole kilogram (minimum 1 kg) before any comparison or charge.\n\n\u00a73 Chargeable weight. PARCELS are charged on whichever is larger: actual weight, or volumetric weight (L x W x H in cm divided by 4000), each rounded up first. DOCUMENTS are never charged on volumetric weight.\n\n\u00a74 Base price. Zone A: 420 for the first kg, then 240 per further kg; Zone B: 850 for the first kg, then 250 per further kg; Zone C: 910 for the first kg, then 270 per further kg.\n\n\u00a75 Claims. Loss or damage must be reported within 14 days of the delivery date with photographs of the packaging.\n\n\u00a76 Surcharges. A weekend collection (Sat/Sun) adds 15% of the base price, rounded down; the percentage is never applied to other surcharges. A flat remote-area fee of 400 cents applies when the postcode starts with JU or GE; it is added after percentage surcharges.\n\n\u00a77 Discounts. GOLD accounts receive 15% off the total after all surcharges (rounded down to a whole cent). The GOLD discount is not available on Zone B consignments.\n\n\u00a78 Cap. A DOCUMENT never costs more than 1100 cents in total, after all surcharges and discounts.\n\n\u00a79 Delivery times. Zone A: next working day. Zone B: two working days. Zone C: three to five working days.",
